OL,3,GNEWSATravel warning over city road
OL,4,Aclosure for works
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been warned about possible
OL,7,Ftravel disruption as a road is to close
OL,8,Ffor repairs.
OL,10,FResurfacing works in Brunton Avenue,
OL,11,Fwhich leads off the busy A69 in
OL,12,FCarlisle, are to start on Monday, with
OL,13,Fthe street to shut for five days
OL,14,Fbetween 08:00 and 17:00 BST, Cumberland
OL,15,FCouncil said.
OL,17,FIt forms part of the council's #27.3m
OL,18,Finvestment into improving Cumberland's
OL,19,Froads, the authority said.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
